", "Imagination", "logical"], "long_description": "A House which is full of many kinds of mistery, imagination makes players fell nervous, exciting and fuuny. In the House, the mental capability is the mainly judgement whether can you conduct the House or not. Memory, the ability of space imagination and the ability of overcoming difficulty, logical inference and your main attention which all can not be less. With this game, you will know that you have the strong ability of the Mental Capability and also you will know how strong the potential of the Mental Capability of human.\nOf course, don't be worry about it, because it brings you much to acknowledge how interesting of this game that all beyond your imagination.\n", "short_description": "<Wisdom House> is a Puzzle game with much funny and mistery. It will open your mental capability when you play in the House.  It's  full of intersting and exciting in this game, players will be immersed with your VR device."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.1ciy-tech.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.1ciy-tech.com/", "publisher_name": "Cubes Technology Team", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.1ciy-tech.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["PUZZLE", "SOCIAL", "EDUCATIONAL", "ADVENTURE", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3214961395451565"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386360_339407343067045